      and the dialog and board refresh in place.
    - Fixed a live-refresh regression the dropdown introduced: opening the
      dialog auto-focused the new select, which the editing guard read as
      an active edit and suppressed refresh forever. The close button now
      takes initial focus.

0.32  2026-08-06
