0.28  2026-08-06
    - Fixed drag-and-drop on iPhone: iOS browsers (all WebKit) kept
      claiming the moving finger for scrolling, so an armed drag's ghost
      never tracked. Once the hold arms a drag, a non-passive touchmove
      listener blocks native scrolling until release; before the hold,
      scrolling is untouched. Long-press callout suppressed on cards.

